Package: etlee110
Title: Personal Website of Ethan Lee
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Ethan",
           family = "Lee",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "ethanlee@g.harvard.edu")
Description: Source for Ethan Lee's personal website, built with pkgdown and
    published on GitHub Pages. It includes a daily-updated list of recent arXiv
    papers on selected topics.
Depends: R (>= 4.5.0)
Suggests: knitr, rmarkdown, pkgdown, quarto
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
URL: https://etlee110.github.io/, https://github.com/etlee110/etlee110.github.io
BugReports: https://github.com/etlee110/etlee110.github.io/issues
Config/Needs/website: httr2, xml2, htmltools
